    "&7Fire Resistance is a must."
  ],
  "quest.4F5BB6DA8DBCB041.title": "&fIllager bases (D＆T)",
  "quest.4F5BB6DA8DBCB041.quest_subtitle": "&7Where: Overworld",
  "quest.4F5BB6DA8DBCB041.quest_desc": [
    "&bWhere: Overworld",
    "&fMobs: pillagers, vindicators, witches, evokers",
    "&cOver 60 mobs can pile up:",
